    <profile name="Gravis Praesidium Shield" typeId="d4b8-6c36-8bad-c884" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="cc42-5767-4f58-d390">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1cc-ea5e-6a1d-d78e">A Gravis Praesidium shield confers a 4+ Invulnerable Save, this does not stack with existing Invulnerable Saves and if a model has more than one such save the controlling player must select one to use against any Wounds inflicted on that model. In addition, a model with a Gravis Praesidium shield cannot claim bonus attacks for having more than one melee weapon, or make attacks during the Assault phase using a weapon with the Two-handed special rule.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
